<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - cloudy, rain, thunderstorms, max 26 C.</title>
<headline>HK weather - cloudy, rain, thunderstorms, max 26 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be cloudy with rain which will be heavy at times, the Royal Observatory said on Monday.</p>
<p>There will be a few squally thunderstorms, while a thunderstorm warning is on until 9 a.m.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will be about 26 C.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 23 C and the relative humidity 93 per cent, the observatory said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
